    "camera_distance_mm_fov45": "distance from center that frames the bounding sphere with a 45deg vertical FOV",
    "used_in": "README 'Individual Part Files' tables: Common Parts = both, Leader-Specific = leader, Follower-Specific = follower; mounting plates = both (print ONE per arm by driver board brand); gauges/assembly = other",
    "volume_cm3": "absolute signed volume of the triangle soup (solid material volume for watertight parts, not filament at infill)",
    "gauges_header": "gauges/*.STL are binary STLs whose 80-byte header begins with 'solid'; three.js STLLoader handles them (size check), naive ASCII sniffers may not"
